13. Interview Questions

What is internal data structure of PriorityQueue?
→ Binary heap (array).

Is PriorityQueue sorted?
→ No, but root element is always smallest/largest.

What’s the time complexity of insertion/removal?
→ O(log n).

Can it contain nulls?
→ ❌ No.

How to make it Max-Heap?
→ Use custom comparator (a, b) -> b - a.

